1
00:00:34,742 --> 00:00:37,060
What's this smell?

2
00:00:38,413 --> 00:00:40,158
What was that sound?

3
00:00:40,565 --> 00:00:41,678
Where are you going?

4
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:43,735
No, I hate this.

5
00:00:43,736 --> 00:00:45,652
It's crazy.

6
00:00:48,642 --> 00:00:49,609
HARUTO!

7
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:50,757
JEONG WOO!

8
00:00:50,758 --> 00:00:51,603
JUNG HWAN!

9
00:00:51,604 --> 00:00:52,828
YOSHI!

10
00:00:52,829 --> 00:00:54,019
HYUN SUK!

11
00:00:56,265 --> 00:00:57,586
Where are you going?

12
00:00:58,315 --> 00:00:59,780
Where are you going?

13
00:01:00,709 --> 00:01:02,906
I'm not kidding, I really can't do this.

14
00:01:04,331 --> 00:01:06,273
I'm just too scared!

15
00:01:07,290 --> 00:01:08,988
I'm alone.

16
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:10,679
Are all the TREASURE members here?

17
00:01:20,244 --> 00:01:21,578
What?

18
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,956
Hey!

19
00:01:36,662 --> 00:01:38,541
I don't want to take the blindfold off.

20
00:02:11,947 --> 00:02:14,213
This is...

21
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:21,384
It's...

22
00:02:30,110 --> 00:02:30,852
Huh?

23
00:02:41,588 --> 00:02:42,610
JEONG WOO!

24
00:03:14,283 --> 00:03:15,226
What?

25
00:03:20,428 --> 00:03:21,537
Gosh, that scared me.

26
00:03:23,635 --> 00:03:24,360
What?

27
00:03:28,281 --> 00:03:29,130
A phone?

28
00:03:38,766 --> 00:03:39,327
What?

29
00:03:40,381 --> 00:03:41,550
It's a phone.

30
00:03:43,451 --> 00:03:44,443
Huh?

31
00:03:50,386 --> 00:03:51,011
Huh?

32
00:03:53,993 --> 00:03:55,365
It has my name on it.

33
00:03:56,684 --> 00:03:57,733
A meesage.

34
00:03:58,138 --> 00:03:59,357
How do I do this?

35
00:03:59,358 --> 00:04:01,666
From the basement to the fourth floor

36
00:04:01,667 --> 00:04:05,512
find the two keys in each floor.

37
00:04:05,513 --> 00:04:09,128
During the hide and seek, if you get caught

38
00:04:09,129 --> 00:04:11,977
you can use the key to be freed again.

39
00:04:13,013 --> 00:04:14,312
Two in each floor?

40
00:04:14,611 --> 00:04:16,949
They've really prepared properly for this.

41
00:04:18,045 --> 00:04:20,885
It's totally different to what we've done so far.

42
00:04:23,852 --> 00:04:26,091
It's quite scary here.

43
00:04:28,345 --> 00:04:29,597
I'll be quiet.

44
00:04:30,574 --> 00:04:31,966
I'll go downstairs first.

45
00:04:49,398 --> 00:04:50,578
Two in each floor?

46
00:04:57,164 --> 00:04:58,012
I'm sorry.

47
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:01,084
It was you.

48
00:05:05,162 --> 00:05:06,277
Let's turn this off.

49
00:05:12,180 --> 00:05:13,446
I really can't do this.

50
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:19,926
Gosh, that scared me!

51
00:05:26,743 --> 00:05:28,892
I thought about this before.

52
00:05:29,370 --> 00:05:30,509
It could be something like

53
00:05:30,510 --> 00:05:33,210
finding an item, like the Running Man.

54
00:05:33,665 --> 00:05:35,362
Look, in here

55
00:05:35,363 --> 00:05:37,593
you can tell

56
00:05:37,594 --> 00:05:39,077
it's not somewhere I shouldn't go.

57
00:05:39,796 --> 00:05:40,651
Right?

58
00:05:40,652 --> 00:05:41,712
Look.

59
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:44,194
But there's no camera here.

60
00:05:44,195 --> 00:05:45,295
Maybe I shouldn't go there.

61
00:05:45,296 --> 00:05:46,050
Sorry.

62
00:05:48,330 --> 00:05:49,385
Here.

63
00:05:50,077 --> 00:05:51,176
Let's find a place to hide.

64
00:05:51,852 --> 00:05:54,370
I need to check these places

65
00:05:55,216 --> 00:05:56,413
