66
00:05:58,764 --> 00:05:59,769
Let's start.

67
00:06:00,527 --> 00:06:01,231
Start!

68
00:06:01,970 --> 00:06:05,446
Find the two keys in each floor.

69
00:06:12,453 --> 00:06:14,729
Hmm, keys.

70
00:06:15,504 --> 00:06:16,376
There's none here.

71
00:06:24,408 --> 00:06:28,297
I don't know what the keys look like.

72
00:06:34,892 --> 00:06:35,782
ASAHI.

73
00:06:36,942 --> 00:06:37,987
ASAHI.

74
00:06:38,925 --> 00:06:40,166
What, are you caught?

75
00:06:40,507 --> 00:06:41,390
No.

76
00:06:41,391 --> 00:06:43,110
ASAHI, do you have the keys?

77
00:06:43,293 --> 00:06:45,113
No, I'm still looking for them.

78
00:06:45,410 --> 00:06:45,989
Right.

79
00:06:45,990 --> 00:06:47,157
I'll go and find them!

80
00:06:55,192 --> 00:06:56,123
Okay.

81
00:06:56,124 --> 00:06:57,041
I'll look for them.

82
00:06:58,512 --> 00:06:59,539
Why is there

83
00:06:59,930 --> 00:07:01,038
