84
00:07:01,888 --> 00:07:03,737
Finding the keys is a good thing.

85
00:07:03,738 --> 00:07:05,833
And it's even better if I know which floor I'm on.

86
00:07:13,610 --> 00:07:16,112
I shouldn't be looking like this.

87
00:07:16,113 --> 00:07:18,097
They'll tease me again.

88
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:19,758
Huh?

89
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:28,957
Hello?

90
00:07:31,407 --> 00:07:32,278
Who are you?

91
00:07:33,724 --> 00:07:35,082
Are you Choi HYUN SUK?

92
00:07:35,591 --> 00:07:36,456
Who are you?

93
00:07:38,023 --> 00:07:39,053
You are...

94
00:07:41,947 --> 00:07:43,336
I'm actually JUNKYU.

95
00:07:44,022 --> 00:07:45,000
What?

96
00:07:45,646 --> 00:07:47,618
Are you locked in a jail?

97
00:07:47,619 --> 00:07:48,501
No.

98
00:07:49,147 --> 00:07:50,298
Are you in a jail?

99
00:07:50,714 --> 00:07:53,036
Yes, I'm locked in a jail.

100
00:07:53,037 --> 00:07:56,906
If you find a key, can you let me out?

101
00:07:56,907 --> 00:07:58,852
I think I just found some keys.

102
00:08:00,302 --> 00:08:02,102
But I'm not sure if these are real

103
00:08:02,103 --> 00:08:04,970
so I'll check and and let you know.

104
00:08:04,971 --> 00:08:06,770
Okay.

105
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,094
It was JUNKYU.

106
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:14,956
How did he know my number though?

107
00:08:17,618 --> 00:08:19,128
How does he know my number?

108
00:08:19,966 --> 00:08:21,166
Phone book.

109
00:08:25,152 --> 00:08:26,775
How did he know my number?

110
00:08:29,528 --> 00:08:32,169
There's Choi HYUN SUK's number and YOSHI's number.

111
00:08:38,097 --> 00:08:38,924
JEONG WOO.

112
00:08:38,924 --> 00:08:39,749
Yes, JUNG HWAN.

113
00:08:40,499 --> 00:08:41,539
Be quiet.

114
00:08:42,076 --> 00:08:43,193
Do we have to stay quiet?

115
00:08:43,193 --> 00:08:44,307
I don't know, just be quiet.

116
00:08:44,308 --> 00:08:46,117
Don't you think there might be some items?

117
00:08:47,622 --> 00:08:48,871
No, I don't think so.

118
00:08:49,930 --> 00:08:50,884
I'm looking for them.

119
00:08:51,532 --> 00:08:52,726
It's a walkie-talkie.

120
00:08:52,727 --> 00:08:54,442
Hey!

121
00:08:54,443 --> 00:08:55,745
JUNGHWAN, grab a walkie-talkie.

122
00:08:55,746 --> 00:08:56,717
Okay.

123
00:08:58,864 --> 00:08:59,869
What was that sound?

124
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:00,540
Hey.

125
00:09:17,588 --> 00:09:18,357
Hey.

126
00:09:18,705 --> 00:09:19,764
How do I use the walkie-talkie?

127
00:09:20,379 --> 00:09:21,176
Turn it on.

128
00:09:32,248 --> 00:09:33,053
Is that JEONG WOO?

129
00:09:34,414 --> 00:09:35,616
You scared me.

130
00:09:35,967 --> 00:09:37,289
We found a walkie-talkie.

131
00:09:37,674 --> 00:09:38,539
What?

132
00:09:38,540 --> 00:09:39,593
Can we go out?

133
00:09:39,594 --> 00:09:40,580
Yes, there's something.

134
00:09:40,525 --> 00:09:41,993
Come out, hurry.

135
00:09:41,994 --> 00:09:43,465
Let's check the third floor first.

136
00:09:43,466 --> 00:09:44,508
Are we going?

137
00:09:44,509 --> 00:09:45,111
Yes.

138
00:09:45,112 --> 00:09:46,282
There was a photo.

139
00:09:47,430 --> 00:09:48,049
A photo?

140
00:09:48,222 --> 00:09:49,199
A photo of a baby.

141
00:09:49,942 --> 00:09:51,224
Two in each floor?

142
00:09:51,577 --> 00:09:54,653
I'm scared, I can't find them on my own.

143
00:09:55,111 --> 00:09:56,065
I'm scared.

144
00:09:57,443 --> 00:09:58,609
What do they look like?

145
00:10:00,242 --> 00:10:01,409
YOSHI!

146
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:04,844
You're not it, are you?

147
00:10:04,845 --> 00:10:05,875
I'm not.

148
00:10:06,445 --> 00:10:08,608
- Two on each floor.
- Let's find the keys.

149
00:10:09,012 --> 00:10:10,484
Ah, there are two on each floor?

150
00:10:10,485 --> 00:10:11,096
Yes.

151
00:10:12,217 --> 00:10:13,903
Do you want to stay with me? I'm a little scared.

152
00:10:13,904 --> 00:10:14,468
Let's stay together.

153
00:10:14,469 --> 00:10:15,381
Let's stay together for now.

154
00:10:15,382 --> 00:10:15,853
Okay.

155
00:10:16,353 --> 00:10:17,691
If we find the key

156
00:10:17,692 --> 00:10:19,230
the one who find it gets to keep it.

157
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:23,990
I found something that look like keys.

158
00:10:24,609 --> 00:10:26,225
But I'm not sure if this is the one.

159
00:10:37,139 --> 00:10:39,240
How do I go past here?

160
00:10:40,996 --> 00:10:42,680
I can't see anything.

161
00:10:44,454 --> 00:10:45,079
But...

162
00:10:46,201 --> 00:10:47,904
How do I do this?

163
00:10:47,905 --> 00:10:49,042
How can they

164
00:10:49,043 --> 00:10:51,157
expect someone to do this?

165
00:10:53,248 --> 00:10:54,533
I found the keys.

166
00:10:54,534 --> 00:10:55,302
Where?

167
00:10:55,985 --> 00:10:56,807
There are several.

168
00:10:56,808 --> 00:10:57,707
Those might not be it.

169
00:10:57,708 --> 00:10:59,564
That phone bell is scary, right?

170
00:10:59,565 --> 00:11:01,470
Yes, it really is!

171
00:11:02,299 --> 00:11:03,131
Let's stay together.

172
00:11:04,564 --> 00:11:05,770
Okay, I'm scared.

173
00:11:44,221 --> 00:11:45,151
Hey!

174
00:11:45,152 --> 00:11:46,016
Yes.

175
00:11:46,017 --> 00:11:46,710
JIHOON?

176
00:11:46,711 --> 00:11:47,715
Yes, come up.

177
00:11:48,131 --> 00:11:48,927
JAE HYUK.

178
00:11:48,928 --> 00:11:49,547
What are you doing?

179
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:50,656
Hey!

180
00:11:51,524 --> 00:11:52,746
What's that?

181
00:11:52,747 --> 00:11:53,156
Huh?

182
00:11:53,157 --> 00:11:53,548
What's that?

183
00:11:53,549 --> 00:11:54,192
A nightstick.

184
00:11:54,595 --> 00:11:55,954
Why? Are you a spy?

185
00:11:55,955 --> 00:11:57,180
No, it's just a weapon.

186
00:11:57,181 --> 00:11:58,212
You scared me.

187
00:11:58,495 --> 00:11:59,574
JAE HYUK, come here.

188
00:11:59,575 --> 00:12:01,178
I think it's better if we stay together.

189
00:12:01,179 --> 00:12:03,177
I was alone on the fourth floor and got really scared.

190
00:12:03,178 --> 00:12:03,981
Are we on the fourth floor?

191
00:12:03,982 --> 00:12:04,957
No, this is the third floor.

192
00:12:05,524 --> 00:12:06,437
Have you searched everywhere?

193
00:12:06,438 --> 00:12:07,366
Yes, I've searched everywhere.

194
00:12:07,367 --> 00:12:08,116
Where's the key?

195
00:12:08,117 --> 00:12:09,495
It was in that room.

196
00:12:10,085 --> 00:12:10,948
JEONG WOO.

197
00:12:10,949 --> 00:12:12,927
There's another door over the window.

198
00:12:12,928 --> 00:12:13,708
Did you see it?

199
00:12:13,988 --> 00:12:14,884
I didn't look there.

200
00:12:22,580 --> 00:12:23,249
Huh?

201
00:12:39,777 --> 00:12:40,678
JAE HYUK.

202
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:41,490
HARUTO.

203
00:12:42,391 --> 00:12:43,083
HARUTO!

204
00:12:44,065 --> 00:12:44,896
HARUTO.

205
00:12:44,897 --> 00:12:45,602
JAE HYUK.

206
00:12:45,603 --> 00:12:46,296
HARUTO.

207
00:12:46,297 --> 00:12:46,775
Yes.

208
00:12:46,776 --> 00:12:47,906
- Come.
- Where?

209
00:12:48,291 --> 00:12:48,918
Come here.

210
00:12:51,511 --> 00:12:53,469
Who do you think will fall for that?

211
00:12:53,470 --> 00:12:54,630
HARUTO, quick.

212
00:12:54,631 --> 00:12:56,194
No.

213
00:12:56,195 --> 00:12:57,179
Don't come, then!

214
00:12:57,779 --> 00:12:59,262
I'm scared.

215
00:13:03,605 --> 00:13:04,784
The smog, gosh.

216
00:13:06,482 --> 00:13:07,382
HARUTO.

217
00:13:07,873 --> 00:13:09,230
Please trust me, just once.

218
00:13:11,014 --> 00:13:12,408
I bet our friendship.

219
00:13:13,686 --> 00:13:14,931
I want to go in here.

220
00:13:23,953 --> 00:13:25,775
I want to go in but I can't.

221
00:13:28,105 --> 00:13:29,209
There's a walkie-talkie there.

222
00:13:30,964 --> 00:13:32,312
Someone come with me.

223
00:13:33,707 --> 00:13:35,391
You have to film me anyway, so can you come with me?

224
00:13:37,009 --> 00:13:37,786
No?

225
00:13:43,206 --> 00:13:44,269
JEONG WOO!

226
00:13:44,270 --> 00:13:45,054
Huh?

227
00:13:45,055 --> 00:13:45,982
Come over here.

228
00:13:45,983 --> 00:13:46,789
Why?

229
00:13:46,790 --> 00:13:48,223
- There's a suspicious room here.
- Where are you?

230
00:13:48,224 --> 00:13:48,979
Where are you?

231
00:13:49,410 --> 00:13:51,058
He's acting strange.

232
00:13:51,059 --> 00:13:52,679
JEONG WOO, I bet our friendship on this, please!

233
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:53,867
Where are you?

234
00:13:53,868 --> 00:13:55,611
Here.

235
00:13:55,612 --> 00:13:56,003
Why?

236
00:13:56,004 --> 00:13:57,184
There's a walkie-talkie in there.

237
00:13:57,580 --> 00:13:59,223
I want to go in

238
00:13:59,224 --> 00:14:00,624
but there's too much smog.

239
00:14:01,983 --> 00:14:02,954
Look, you know what I mean?

240
00:14:03,755 --> 00:14:04,602
There are boxes and stuff.

241
00:14:04,603 --> 00:14:05,796
I think it's the same walkie-talkie.

242
00:14:05,797 --> 00:14:06,779
This one, right?

243
00:14:07,283 --> 00:14:08,300
Can we connect with walkie-talkies?

244
00:14:08,301 --> 00:14:09,127
We need to take that, then.

245
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:10,671
There's something in here.

246
00:14:12,199 --> 00:14:13,778
Why is there smog in this room?

247
00:14:13,779 --> 00:14:14,719
I know.

248
00:14:16,283 --> 00:14:17,115
Let's go in.

249
00:14:18,148 --> 00:14:19,182
Can you go first?

250
00:14:19,183 --> 00:14:20,380
You're the oldest here.

251
00:14:21,023 --> 00:14:21,855
There are stairs.

252
00:14:21,856 --> 00:14:22,857
You only call me hyung at times like this.

253
00:14:22,858 --> 00:14:23,885
There are stairs, I'm scared.

254
00:14:23,886 --> 00:14:25,326
There are boxes and stuff in here.

255
00:14:27,725 --> 00:14:30,003
There are stairs so be careful when you run away.

256
00:14:30,225 --> 00:14:30,974
Right.

257
00:14:31,495 --> 00:14:33,130
I think there's something on the floor.

258
00:14:33,131 --> 00:14:34,544
I'm sure, for definite.

259
00:14:34,545 --> 00:14:36,195
Why else would they have so much smog in here?

260
00:14:36,196 --> 00:14:37,157
Rock, paper, scissors.

261
00:14:37,158 --> 00:14:39,084
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot!

262
00:14:39,691 --> 00:14:40,736
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot!

263
00:14:40,737 --> 00:14:41,513
Wait, here.

264
00:14:43,150 --> 00:14:45,142
What?

265
00:14:45,143 --> 00:14:46,409
What did you do?

266
00:14:46,410 --> 00:14:47,380
That opened.

267
00:14:47,381 --> 00:14:48,808
Calm down.

268
00:14:49,301 --> 00:14:51,217
It could have just opened because of the wind.

269
00:14:54,145 --> 00:14:55,766
I'm really scared.

270
00:14:57,441 --> 00:14:58,923
There must be something here.

271
00:15:05,702 --> 00:15:06,493
None?

272
00:15:06,494 --> 00:15:07,237
No.

273
00:15:07,850 --> 00:15:08,917
There should be something.

274
00:15:09,692 --> 00:15:10,705
No, I looked everywhere.

275
00:15:12,059 --> 00:15:12,754
Hey!

276
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:18,010
Nice.

277
00:15:18,011 --> 00:15:19,489
We didn't go in here.

278
00:15:19,490 --> 00:15:21,088
It's too scary here.

279
00:15:21,611 --> 00:15:22,449
This place shouldn't be it.

280
00:15:28,696 --> 00:15:30,735
But there's a camera there, so there must be something.

281
00:15:30,736 --> 00:15:31,737
I think.

282
00:15:32,354 --> 00:15:33,127
Right?

283
00:15:33,814 --> 00:15:34,715
Is there a key?

284
00:15:35,247 --> 00:15:35,631
Huh?

285
00:15:35,632 --> 00:15:36,442
You found the key?

286
00:15:37,738 --> 00:15:38,536
Is that it?

287
00:15:38,854 --> 00:15:39,913
We need to find a key?

288
00:15:39,914 --> 00:15:40,975
Isn't this the key?

289
00:15:40,976 --> 00:15:41,741
Did they say we need to find a key?

290
00:15:41,742 --> 00:15:42,211
Yes.

291
00:15:42,212 --> 00:15:42,625
